DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The mmvvrrnngg driver provides support for the random number generator found
     on the Marvell ARMADA 7K/8K SoCs.

     It feeds the random subsystem's entropy pool with 128 bits of random data
     every second.

